                                        "entry_id": "e9d41b7e-ada6-39c6-929f-430fcef13937",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Increasing or decreasing by an arithmetic progression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85dbbc0b-5ae6-4d81-9a9d-42ea451563fe",
                                                "sense_id": "62c47d61-72df-349d-87f6-d7ad42c78e92",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: linear"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "582f61b1-eb9f-49ca-9780-f9e0515efba9",
                                                "sense_id": "62c47d61-72df-349d-87f6-d7ad42c78e92",
                                                "text": "Growth in the most mature markets is likely to be arithmetic; on what rational basis could one hope for exponential growth there?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "arithmetic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f33d540c-6a9e-3c6b-8418-5b85dd0d91bd",
                                        "entry_id": "c48c3152-e13b-3c08-af15-2e569f066bc5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of, relating to, or using arithmetic; arithmetical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c16dd7b-75b2-4855-994e-8945fd640523",
                                                "sense_id": "f33d540c-6a9e-3c6b-8418-5b85dd0d91bd",
                                                "text": "arithmetic geometry"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b10577ba-f8e7-4466-91fa-a23ba077c7c1",
                                                "sense_id": "f33d540c-6a9e-3c6b-8418-5b85dd0d91bd",
                                                "text": "Moreover, the latest work of Katz, involving the so-called 'Larsen alternative', provides new criteria, of a very arithmetic nature, to (almost) determine the rational monodromy group"
